ified records are stored?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_04_e_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_04_e_67","text":"Yes. If I were to put it simply, you could call this an archive of forbidden books.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_04_e_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_04_e_68","text":"Kinda like in fantasy novels","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_04_e_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_04_e_69","text":"when they've got places where they keep dangerous and forbidden knowledge or magic.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_04_e_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_04_e_70","text":"Although there isn't any forbidden magic here.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_04_e_71","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_04_e_71","text":"Then what is in here?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arcanearchive_04_e_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_arcanearchive_04_e_72","text":"Top-secret records, which are very dangerous.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"mov